# FARMFUND — COMPLETE APP REDESIGN, FOUR-ROLE REGISTRATION AND SEPARATE DASHBOARDS

You are continuing development of the existing FarmFund application.

Your task is to restructure and improve the entire existing application around four distinct user roles:

1. Worker
2. Farmer
3. Supervisor
4. Sponsor

This is a major application-wide UI, UX, navigation, registration and dashboard restructuring task.

IMPORTANT: Do not create a new application or replace the existing project. Work directly inside the current FarmFund codebase.

Preserve the existing technology stack, Firebase integration, database, authentication, Stellar wallet infrastructure, payment services, messaging functionality and other working integrations.

Do not unnecessarily remove existing working features. Reorganise them according to the new role structure and requirements below.

The final application must feel like one connected agricultural platform with four completely separate user experiences.

