# 8. IMPORTANT REQUEST AND AGREEMENT WORKFLOWS

Connect all four roles through clear, controlled workflows.

### Farmer ↔ Sponsor

- Farmer discovers sponsor.
- Farmer sends a support request.
- Sponsor receives the request.
- Sponsor reviews and responds.
- Parties agree on the terms.
- Both accept the agreement.
- The project becomes eligible for supervision if required.
- Assigned supervisor monitors the project.
- Payments and support fulfilment follow the agreement.

### Worker ↔ Farmer or Sponsor

- Farmer or authorised sponsor publishes a job.
- Worker discovers the job.
- Worker submits an application.
- Job owner reviews the application.
- Job owner accepts or declines.
- Accepted worker and hiring party agree on the work and wage.
- Supervision can be requested.
- Work is carried out.
- Completion is confirmed under the agreement.
- Worker payment is processed according to the agreed payment arrangement.

### Supervisor assignment

- A sponsor, farmer or other authorised agreement party requests supervision.
- An eligible supervisor is selected or invited.
- Supervisor reviews the project information and assignment terms.
- Supervisor accepts or declines.
- Accepted supervision assignment appears in the Supervisor Dashboard.
- Supervisor submits progress reports and completion observations.
- Relevant parties can review the reports.

A supervisor must never gain access to a project merely because they have registered on FarmFund.

